alse\" data-tex=\"$\\exp _p$\">$\\exp _p$</span> is defined for all <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$v\\in T_pM$\">$v\\in T_pM$</span>; i.e. if any geodesic <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\gamma (t)$\">$\\gamma (t)$</span> starting from <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$p$\">$p$</span> is defined for all values of the parameter <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$t\\in \\mathbb {R}$\">$t\\in \\mathbb {R}$</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#def:dc-ch7-2-1","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-3-geodesic-push","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-expmap","title":"def:dc-ch3-expmap","label":"def:dc-ch3-expmap"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#prop:dc-ch7-2-3","title":"prop:dc-ch7-2-3","label":"prop:dc-ch7-2-3"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#thm:dc-ch7-2-8","title":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8","label":"thm:dc-ch7-2-8"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","title":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d","label":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-c-to-d"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-8-a-to-b","title":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-a-to-b","label":"lem:dc-ch7-2-8-a-to-b"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#cor:dc-ch7-2-9","title":"cor:dc-ch7-2-9","label":"cor:dc-ch7-2-9"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-3-expmap-global","title":"lem:dc-ch7